[^5]: **Numisplatia** (IPA: /ˈnumisplaˈtia/) - Νομισπλατια: Mintright, Coin Minting Rights.
[^6]: **Waaioplatia** (IPA: /ˈwaioplaˈtia/) - Βααιοπλατια: Waagright, Weigh House Rights.
